        "TileImage": "$($repository a2429d84-2b78-42c4-a88d-82b8984ca92d).Image",
        "Description": "Greetings 47. \r\rSome  says  revenge is a dish best servred cold, but why not turn up the heatevery now and then? Sichuan cuisine often uses Mala seasoning  a potent mix of ma {numbing} and la {spicy}  ingrediants. A bit of heat, a bit of shock and you get an explsion of flavor and a  dish to die or. \r\rI leave you to prepare 47. A buffet of targets awaits. \r\rContract by Mr Nezu",
